    <p>Because the seller is Apple or Google, withdrawal from a purchase and refunds are governed by the rules of the relevant store. You request a refund in the App Store (reportaproblem.apple.com) or in Google Play. Please note that for digital content supplied online, the right of withdrawal ceases under Section 1837(l) of the Czech Civil Code once performance has begun with your prior express consent and acknowledgement that you lose that right.</p>

